{"seq":2,"slug":"memory-block-cache-budget","title":"内存预算治理：write buffer、block cache 与内存分配器","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/performance-write-stall-memory/memory-block-cache-budget","wordCount":2205,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"内存预算治理-write-buffer-block-cache-与内存分配器\">内存预算治理：write buffer、block cache 与内存分配器</h1><p>一台 16 GB 的机器上跑着 RocksDB，RSS 却涨到 22 GB 然后被 OOM Killer 杀掉——这类事故几乎从不出现在单一选项配错上，而是「没有为进程内的每一本内存账都设上限」。RocksDB 的内存不是一个数字，而是 memtable、block cache、索引/过滤器、迭代器 pin 住的块、分配器保留的空闲页这五类互相挤占的总和。把内存当成一个共享预算来分配与观测，才是正确的治理单位。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-一个进程里的五本内存账\">核心概念：一个进程里的五本内存账</h2><p>官方把内存使用归为四个用户——block cache、index/filter block、memtable、以及被迭代器 pin 住的块（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Memory-usage-in-RocksDB\">Memory usage in RocksDB</a>）；第五类是分配器开销，不在任何 RocksDB 选项的管辖范围内，却是 RSS 超发最常见的元凶。关键在弄清哪几项<strong>默认不计入</strong> block cache 的容量统计：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[进程 RSS] --&gt; B[RocksDB 显式预算]&#10;    A --&gt; C[分配器保留页]&#10;    B --&gt; D[block cache&lt;br/&gt;NewLRUCache capacity]&#10;    B --&gt; E[memtable&lt;br/&gt;write_buffer_size × n]&#10;    B --&gt; F[index / filter block&lt;br/&gt;默认在 cache 之外]&#10;    B --&gt; G[迭代器 pinned block]&#10;    D --&gt; H{共享一个 Cache 对象?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[跨列族单一上限]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[总内存 = 列族数 × 上限]&#10;    C --&gt; K[jemalloc decay + arena 碎片]\">graph TD\n    A[进程 RSS] --&gt; B[RocksDB 显式预算]\n    A --&gt; C[分配器保留页]\n    B --&gt; D[block cache&lt;br/&gt;NewLRUCache capacity]\n    B --&gt; E[memtable&lt;br/&gt;write_buffer_size × n]\n    B --&gt; F[index / filter block&lt;br/&gt;默认在 cache 之外]\n    B --&gt; G[迭代器 pinned block]\n    D --&gt; H{共享一个 Cache 对象?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[跨列族单一上限]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[总内存 = 列族数 × 上限]\n    C --&gt; K[jemalloc decay + arena 碎片]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>内存项</th>\n<th>控制选项</th>\n<th>默认</th>\n<th>计入 block cache 容量?</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>memtable</td>\n<td><code>write_buffer_size</code> / <code>max_write_buffer_number</code></td>\n<td>64 MB / 2</td>\n<td>否（除非 WriteBufferManager 挂账）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>block cache（数据块）</td>\n<td><code>NewLRUCache(capacity)</code></td>\n<td>32 MB（8.2 前 8 MB）</td>\n<td>—— 它就是容量本体</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>index / filter block</td>\n<td><code>cache_index_and_filter_blocks</code></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>否（默认）；开启后计入</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>迭代器 pinned block</td>\n<td><code>ReadOptions.pin_data</code>、并发迭代器数</td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>计入 pinned usage，可超容量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>分配器保留页</td>\n<td><code>MALLOC_CONF</code></td>\n<td>jemalloc 默认策略</td>\n<td>完全不可见</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这张表的两个「否」是事故来源。官方给过一个典型症状：给 block cache 分配 10 GB，进程内存却涨到 15 GB，多出来的部分通常就是索引和过滤器（来源：同上）。同理，block cache 默认是<strong>每个列族、每个 DB 实例各自一份</strong>，多列族应用的显存上界是 <code>列族数 × capacity</code>。第一原则是把显式预算之和控制在进程内存预算之内，并为分配器与 OS page cache 留出空间：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>进程</mtext></msub><mo>≥</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>block cache</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>memtable</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>index/filter</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>pinned</mtext></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>allocator</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{进程}} \\ge M_{\\text{block cache}} + M_{\\text{memtable}} + M_{\\text{index/filter}} + M_{\\text{pinned}} + M_{\\text{allocator}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">进程</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">block cache</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">memtable</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0385em;vertical-align:-0.3552em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3448em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.5198em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">index/filter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3552em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pinned</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">allocator</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"write-buffer-预算-memtable-的容量上限与-writebuffermanager\">write buffer 预算：memtable 的容量上限与 WriteBufferManager</h2><p>memtable 的内存上界由两个参数相乘决定，这是估算里最容易算错的一项——「活跃 memtable」和「待刷盘的 immutable memtable」同时占用内存。调优指南的口径是：总 memtable 内存约等于 <code>write_buffer_size × max_write_buffer_number</code>，例如 512 MB × 5 = 2.5 GB（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/RocksDB-Tuning-Guide\">RocksDB Tuning Guide</a>）。<code>write_buffer_size</code> 默认 64 MB，官方建议除非内存受限否则保持不动（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Setup-Options-and-Basic-Tuning\">Setup Options and Basic Tuning</a>）；<code>max_write_buffer_number</code> 默认 2，意味着写满一个 memtable 转入后台 flush 后，前台只剩<strong>一个</strong>活跃 memtable 的余量——这就是写停顿的全部缓冲空间；<code>min_write_buffer_number_to_merge</code> 默认 1，提高它可减少 L0 重复键与写放大，但 immutable memtable 滞留更久。</p>\n<p>多列族场景下逐列族设上限不够：这两个参数默认都<strong>按列族独立计算</strong>。真正做全局预算的工具是 <strong>WriteBufferManager</strong>，把它放进多个列族或 DB 实例的 options 即可统一记账（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Write-Buffer-Manager\">Write Buffer Manager</a>）：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"cpp\" data-code=\"auto wbm = std::make_shared&lt;rocksdb::WriteBufferManager&gt;(&#10;    1ULL &lt;&lt; 30,     // buffer_size：全部列族的 memtable 总上限&#10;    block_cache,    // 可选：把 memtable 内存挂到 block cache 账上&#10;    true);          // allow_stall：超限时反压写者\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> wbm </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> std</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">make_shared</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">rocksdb</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">::</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">WriteBufferManager</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">>(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x3C;&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 30</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">     // buffer_size：全部列族的 memtable 总上限</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    block_cache,</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 可选：把 memtable 内存挂到 block cache 账上</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">          // allow_stall：超限时反压写者</span></span></code></pre></div><p>必须记住三个行为细节：其一，自 5.6 起某列族可变 memtable 用量达到 <code>buffer_size</code> 约 90% 时触发该列族 flush，若总量超限则只有当可变 memtable 也超过 50% 时才更激进地 flush；其二，记账包含 arena 中已分配但尚未使用的内存，反映真实分配占用而非逻辑数据量；其三，传入 <code>cache</code> 后每约 1 MB memtable 分配会在 block cache 插入等量空占位条目，让 cache 驱逐数据块为 memtable 腾位，容量应同时按「数据块 + memtable」定；挂账释放滞后——只有 memtable 用量降到已预留量的 3/4 以下才减少。<code>allow_stall = true</code> 时内存超过 <code>buffer_size</code> 后写者被阻塞直到 flush 释放，单次写可用 <code>WriteOptions::no_slowdown = true</code> 绕过。</p>\n<h2 id=\"block-cache-预算-容量-分片与-index-filter-归属\">block cache 预算：容量、分片与 index/filter 归属</h2><p>block cache 的容量没有普适公式，官方建议是分配<strong>总内存预算的约 1/3</strong>，其余留给 OS page cache 缓存压缩后的数据块（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Setup-Options-and-Basic-Tuning\">Setup Options and Basic Tuning</a>）。缓存分两层：block cache 存<strong>解压后</strong>的数据块，page cache 存<strong>压缩后</strong>的文件块——把 block cache 缩小通常只是把内存转移到 page cache，而非增加 I/O，但会因每次都需解压而抬高 CPU。容量在创建时定下，分片由 <code>num_shard_bits</code> 控制：容量<strong>均分到各分片、分片间不共享</strong>，且<strong>每个分片的最小容量是 512 KB</strong>（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Block-Cache\">Block Cache</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>选项</th>\n<th>默认</th>\n<th>内存影响</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>cache_index_and_filter_blocks</code></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>置 <code>true</code> 让索引/过滤器进 cache 并可被驱逐，通常伤性能</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>pin_l0_filter_and_index_blocks_in_cache</code></td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>L0 的过滤/索引常驻 cache，官方称「有用的折中」</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>strict_capacity_limit</code></td>\n<td><code>false</code></td>\n<td>置 <code>true</code> 后分片满则拒绝插入并让读/迭代失败，<strong>每分片</strong>生效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>optimize_filters_for_memory</code></td>\n<td>——</td>\n<td>「对 jemalloc 更友好」的布隆过滤器定尺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><code>strict_capacity_limit</code> 默认 <code>false</code> 是隐性风险：pinned 块填满某分片后默认<strong>允许容量被突破</strong>——这正是「cache 配 1 GB、pinned usage 却报 2 GB」的成因。pinned 内存按迭代器数量线性增长，官方估算口径是：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>M</mi><mtext>pinned</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>iter</mtext></msub><mo>×</mo><mtext>block_size</mtext><mo>×</mo><mrow><mo fence=\"true\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>N</mi><mtext>L0</mtext></msub><mo fence=\"true\">)</mo></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">M_{\\text{pinned}} \\approx N_{\\text{iter}} \\times \\text{block\\_size} \\times \\left((L-1) + N_{\\text{L0}}\\right)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">pinned</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3175em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">iter</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">block_size</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"minner\"><span class=\"mopen delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">(</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.109em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">L0</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose delimcenter\" style=\"top:0em;\">)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>即每个迭代器为每个 L0 文件 pin 一个数据块，为 L1 及以上每层 pin 一个块。平常它很小，但 10 万级并发读下会变得显著；若开启 <code>ReadOptions::pin_data = true</code>，迭代器会在生命周期内 pin 住遍历过的所有块。索引与过滤器不进 cache 时，内存由 <code>max_open_files</code> 间接约束：置 <code>-1</code> 会预加载全部 reader/索引/过滤器，性能最好、内存占用也最大（来源：同上）。降低过滤器内存的实路是 <code>optimize_filters_for_hits = true</code>：默认布隆过滤器为每位 10 bit、约 1% 假阳性，规模约为 <code>键数 × 10 bit</code>，跳过占数据库约 90% 的最底层过滤器可把过滤器内存降到约 1/10，代价是每次「查不到」的点读多一次 I/O。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存分配器-jemalloc-的衰减-arena-与-rss-碎片\">内存分配器：jemalloc 的衰减、arena 与 RSS 碎片</h2><p>前四本账都是 RocksDB 显式管理的，第五本不是。内存交还 allocator 之后是否把页还给操作系统，决定了 RSS 曲线是回落还是阶梯式只涨不跌。官方只在一处点名 jemalloc——<code>optimize_filters_for_memory</code> 被描述为「对 jemalloc 更友好的布隆过滤器定尺」（来源：同上）。jemalloc 5.4 的关键旋钮（来源：<a href=\"https://jemalloc.net/jemalloc.3.html\">jemalloc(3) 手册</a>）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>配置</th>\n<th>默认</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>background_thread:true</code></td>\n<td>关闭</td>\n<td>后台线程异步执行 decay/purge，移出分配快路径</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>dirty_decay_ms</code></td>\n<td><code>10000</code>（10 秒）</td>\n<td>脏页衰减时间，调小更快归还内存但 purge 更频繁</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>muzzy_decay_ms</code></td>\n<td><code>0</code>（立即）</td>\n<td>muzzy 页衰减，<code>-1</code> 表示禁用 purge</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>narenas</code></td>\n<td>CPU 数的 4 倍</td>\n<td>arena 过多带来固定碎片增量，<code>narenas:1</code> 可降碎片但可能增锁竞争</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>tcache</code> / <code>tcache_max</code></td>\n<td>开启 / 32 KiB</td>\n<td>线程缓存免同步但增加内存与碎片</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>retain</code></td>\n<td>64 位 Linux 默认开启</td>\n<td>保留虚拟地址空间而非 <code>munmap</code>，影响虚拟地址而非 RSS</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>长驻服务的稳妥起点是 <code>MALLOC_CONF=&#39;background_thread:true,dirty_decay_ms:10000,muzzy_decay_ms:0&#39;</code>；若 RSS 是首要目标，收紧为 <code>dirty_decay_ms:0,muzzy_decay_ms:0</code>。一个坑必须记住：jemalloc 5.4 起通过启动选项 <code>MALLOC_CONF</code> 开启 <code>background_thread</code> <strong>可能在初始化阶段崩溃或死锁</strong>，可靠做法是启动时不设该项、初始化后再用 <code>mallctl(&quot;background_thread&quot;, ...)</code> 动态打开；也可运行期主动回收所有 arena 的未使用脏页。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从内存预算反推写停顿与监控指标\">从内存预算反推写停顿与监控指标</h2><p>内存配置与写停顿是同一枚硬币的两面：写停顿的三个触发条件里有两个直接由内存预算决定（来源：<a href=\"https://github.com/facebook/rocksdb/wiki/Write-Stalls\">Write Stalls</a>）：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>immutable memtable 过多</strong>——待刷盘 memtable 数 ≥ <code>max_write_buffer_number</code> 时写者完全停止；若该值大于 3，则队列达到 <code>max_write_buffer_number - 1</code> 时先减速。</li>\n<li><strong>L0 文件过多</strong>——达到 <code>level0_slowdown_writes_trigger</code>（默认 20）减速，<code>level0_stop_writes_trigger</code>（默认 36）完全停止。</li>\n<li><strong>待压缩字节过多</strong>——达到 <code>soft_pending_compaction_bytes_limit</code>（默认 64 GiB）减速，<code>hard_pending_compaction_bytes_limit</code>（默认 256 GiB）停写。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>关键含义：<code>max_write_buffer_number</code> 设得太小，写停顿会由第一类触发——而这恰恰就是「memtable 内存上限」这个参数；把 <code>write_buffer_size</code> 调大能降低写放大、减少 L0 文件数（缓解第二类触发），代价是 memtable 内存上界同步放大，因此官方建议调大它时同步提高 <code>max_bytes_for_level_base</code>（默认 256 MiB）；<code>arena_block_size</code> 默认 <code>0</code>（自动按 <code>write_buffer_size / 4</code> 计算）。监控四个账本指标（来源：同上）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>指标</th>\n<th>对应账本</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>rocksdb.block-cache-usage</code></td>\n<td>数据块（含挂账的 memtable）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rocksdb.block-cache-pinned-usage</code></td>\n<td>迭代器 pin 住的块</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rocksdb.estimate-table-readers-mem</code></td>\n<td>索引 / 过滤器 / reader</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>rocksdb.cur-size-all-mem-tables</code></td>\n<td>memtable 实际用量</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>陷阱：<code>cache_index_and_filter_blocks</code> 开启时索引/过滤器已含在 block cache usage 里，再与 <code>estimate-table-readers-mem</code> 相加即重复计算；挂账后 <code>block-cache-usage</code> 也已含 memtable。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>RocksDB 的内存是五本账：block cache、memtable、index/filter、pinned block、分配器保留页；显式预算之和必须小于进程内存预算。</li>\n<li>memtable 上界 ≈ <code>write_buffer_size × max_write_buffer_number</code>（默认 64 MB × 2）；多列族时用 WriteBufferManager 全局封顶。</li>\n<li>block cache 建议取总内存预算的约 1/3，容量按分片均分且不共享；<code>strict_capacity_limit</code> 默认 <code>false</code> 意味着 pinned 块可突破容量。</li>\n<li>index/filter 默认不在 block cache 容量内，<code>max_open_files=-1</code> 会显著抬高；<code>optimize_filters_for_hits</code> 是降过滤器内存的实路。</li>\n<li>jemalloc 的 <code>dirty_decay_ms</code>/<code>muzzy_decay_ms</code>/<code>background_thread</code> 决定 RSS 是否回落。</li>\n<li>写停顿三类触发中有两类由内存参数直接决定，内存预算与写停顿调优要一起做。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>相关阅读：<a href=\"../lsm-architecture-write-read/lsm-tree-structure-write-path\">LSM-tree 分层结构与写路径</a>、<a href=\"../sst-format-compaction/sst-file-format-and-index\">SST 文件格式与索引结构</a>。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"内存预算治理：write buffer、block cache 与内存分配器","id":"内存预算治理-write-buffer-block-cache-与内存分配器"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：一个进程里的五本内存账","id":"核心概念-一个进程里的五本内存账"},{"level":2,"text":"write buffer 预算：memtable 的容量上限与 WriteBufferManager","id":"write-buffer-预算-memtable-的容量上限与-writebuffermanager"},{"level":2,"text":"block cache 预算：容量、分片与 index/filter 归属","id":"block-cache-预算-容量-分片与-index-filter-归属"},{"level":2,"text":"内存分配器：jemalloc 的衰减、arena 与 RSS 碎片","id":"内存分配器-jemalloc-的衰减-arena-与-rss-碎片"},{"level":2,"text":"从内存预算反推写停顿与监控指标","id":"从内存预算反推写停顿与监控指标"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"写停顿与背压机制：L0 限速、pending compaction bytes 与 rate limiter","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/performance-write-stall-memory/write-stall-backpressure-mechanism"},"next":{"title":"读写放大度量与调优方法论：STATISTICS/perf context/基准测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/backend-engineering/rocksdb-embedded-lsm-key-value-engine-operations/performance-write-stall-memory/performance-measurement-tuning-method"}}